1
00:00:45,439 --> 00:00:46,439
The real killer

2
00:00:47,479 --> 00:00:48,280
is He Shuyi.

3
00:00:48,759 --> 00:00:49,759
He wanted to harm you,

4
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:51,840
but ended up killing himself.

5
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:02,799
Still, it wasn't a big deal.

6
00:01:03,079 --> 00:01:04,640
I just hated that so many people had used it,

7
00:01:04,719 --> 00:01:06,239
that it was dirty and smelled.

8
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,439
Do you know about cyanide?

9
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:08,920
I studied medicine.

10
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:09,680
Of course I do.

11
00:01:10,319 --> 00:01:11,480
It's highly toxic and lethal.

12
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,040
It hydrolyzes into hydrocyanic acid,

13
00:01:13,159 --> 00:01:14,040
smelling like bitter almonds.

14
00:01:14,599 --> 00:01:16,280
Forty percent of people can't smell it

15
00:01:16,519 --> 00:01:17,840
because they lack the gene for it.

16
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:18,599
Right.

17
00:01:19,359 --> 00:01:20,799
So what does that have to do with the case?

18
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:23,200
There was cyanide on the white bedsheet.

19
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,959
The bitter smell you detected back then

20
00:01:25,239 --> 00:01:26,040
was cyanide.

21
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:27,680
And He Shuyi

22
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:30,000
died of cyanide poisoning.

23
00:01:31,519 --> 00:01:32,120
So...

24
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,920
did I accidentally kill someone?

25
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:38,840
You accidentally

26
00:01:39,439 --> 00:01:40,599
saved your own life.

27
00:01:57,319 --> 00:01:58,640
Before you went to the escape room together,

28
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:00,719
He Shuyi had already been there.

29
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,920
He was heading straight for the ward.

30
00:02:04,239 --> 00:02:05,959
I'm not that close with him.

31
00:02:06,439 --> 00:02:08,080
I don't know why he went into the escape room early.

32
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:10,000
You were interns in the same batch,

33
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:12,080
and you worked at that escape room.

34
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:13,719
He went to the escape room early,

35
00:02:14,319 --> 00:02:15,039
and you had no idea?

36
00:02:15,639 --> 00:02:17,360
My job at the escape room was just part-time!

37
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:20,080
I just brought in friends and classmates

38
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,199
to earn some extra commission.

39
00:02:22,039 --> 00:02:24,039
I really have no idea who let him in.

40
00:02:36,159 --> 00:02:37,599
We watched the escape room lobby footage overnight

41
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,199
and found that the victim, He Shuyi,

42
00:02:39,319 --> 00:02:40,599
had visited the escape room in advance.

43
00:02:40,919 --> 00:02:42,840
It was like casing the joint for a crime.

44
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,560
As a medical student,

45
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,400
he had the chance to set up a "death trap."

46
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:48,960
But without someone's help,

47
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:51,439
he couldn't have freely entered and exited

48
00:02:51,439 --> 00:02:52,120
the escape room ward.

49
00:02:52,719 --> 00:02:54,039
In this matter, Lin Anzhe

50
00:02:55,319 --> 00:02:56,280
is the biggest suspect.

51
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,439
You could even say

52
00:02:58,439 --> 00:02:59,479
he was the one who helped him.

53
00:03:00,039 --> 00:03:00,479
But

54
00:03:00,719 --> 00:03:01,800
we don't have any evidence right now,

55
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,639
so we can't convict him just like that.

56
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:04,680
That makes sense.

57
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,240
From the very start, this kid

58
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:08,800
knew a great deal,

59
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,599
and probably did plenty too.

60
00:03:11,599 --> 00:03:12,759
He just won't talk, I guess.

61
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,039
And besides,

62
00:03:14,879 --> 00:03:16,479
he'll just lead us in circles.

63
00:03:25,719 --> 00:03:26,360
Gu Yan.

64
00:03:27,919 --> 00:03:29,280
Seeing you at work today

65
00:03:29,759 --> 00:03:30,560
made me so happy.

66
00:03:32,039 --> 00:03:32,759
Drop the act.

67
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,479
You already knew who I was, didn't you?

68
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:37,319
I'm just getting to know you again, Gu Yan.

69
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,479
The commemorative clearance coin—

70
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:40,479
you gave it to He Shuyi,

71
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:40,919
didn't you?

72
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:49,159
Anyone who clears the first three stages

73
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,280
gets a commemorative coin.

74
00:03:50,639 --> 00:03:51,639
Xu Xiaoya said

75
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,960
when He Shuyi entered the ward with her,

76
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,360
there was no time gap at first.

77
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,960
But once they lay on the bed,

78
00:03:58,039 --> 00:03:59,439
a two-minute gap appeared.

79
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,199
Those two minutes

80
00:04:02,199 --> 00:04:03,800
are enough time for someone

81
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,000
who knows the escape room to do a lot.

82
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:07,719
Like, for example,

83
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:11,840
giving the clearance coin to He Shuyi.

84
00:04:15,199 --> 00:04:15,680
Shen Yu,

85
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:17,000
without evidence,

86
00:04:17,439 --> 00:04:18,399
don't make wild accusations.

87
00:04:19,319 --> 00:04:20,920
I haven't even left the station lobby yet.

88
00:04:21,319 --> 00:04:22,120
Talking like this

89
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:23,920
will only cause me trouble.

90
00:04:28,839 --> 00:04:29,519
If there's nothing else,

91
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:30,920
I'll be going now.

92
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:32,959
Gu Yan,

93
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,120
bye-bye.

94
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,240
Who would have thought

95
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,639
the escape room killer

96
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:45,560
was actually the victim,

97
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,279
He Shuyi.

98
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:49,519
To prevent Chen Xiaojing from having the baby

99
00:04:49,879 --> 00:04:50,800
and stop the marriage,

100
00:04:51,439 --> 00:04:52,879
He Shuyi planned to use cyanide

101
00:04:52,879 --> 00:04:53,920
to murder her

102
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:55,920
and make it look like she was scared to death.

103
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,199
Chen Xiaojing is an orphan.

104
00:04:58,639 --> 00:04:59,839
The only family she has left

105
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:00,879
are her younger sister and grandma out of town.

106
00:05:01,639 --> 00:05:03,000
With his means and wealth,

107
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,399
it'd be easy to fool them.

108
00:05:06,319 --> 00:05:07,680
He set a death trap in advance,

109
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,720
but because of the argument we caused

110
00:05:10,759 --> 00:05:12,319
and Xu Xiaoya's mix-up,

111
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,079
he ended up killing himself.

112
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,160
As for Xu Xiaoya,

113
00:05:16,759 --> 00:05:18,040
though she's a bit willful and spoiled,

114
00:05:18,839 --> 00:05:20,399
when she thought she was in danger,

115
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,120
crying and throwing a fit,

116
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:23,600
she was actually quite cute.

117
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:27,560
She's young, after all.

118
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,319
They're both college students

119
00:05:30,319 --> 00:05:31,480
with endless possibilities ahead.

120
00:05:38,519 --> 00:05:39,639
Do you recognize this gold coin?

121
00:05:41,439 --> 00:05:42,399
Your father is an alcoholic.

122
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,360
He abused and beat you for years.

123
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:45,920
You hate him,

124
00:05:46,279 --> 00:05:47,920
but you fear him too, don't you?

125
00:05:53,759 --> 00:05:54,680
I killed him.

126
00:05:55,279 --> 00:05:56,319
Killed him.

127
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:57,759
I hate him.

128
00:05:58,319 --> 00:05:59,360
If I killed him,

129
00:05:59,959 --> 00:06:01,879
I could go back to my mother.

130
00:06:02,839 --> 00:06:04,240
Another personality has surfaced.

131
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:06,519
You recognize this, don't you?

132
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:07,720
Who gave it to you?

133
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,160
Kill her.

134
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:14,000
Kill her, and you can see your mother.

135
00:06:26,199 --> 00:06:29,079
Kill her, and you can see your mother.

136
00:06:42,439 --> 00:06:43,480
Kill her.

137
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,600
Kill her.

138
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:46,040
Kill her!

139
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:49,720
Don't be afraid.

140
00:06:50,759 --> 00:06:51,720
No one is going to hurt you.

141
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:52,519
Tell me.

142
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:53,519
Who was that person?

143
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:55,040
What did they look like?

144
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:57,319
Na...

145
00:06:57,639 --> 00:06:58,199
Name...

146
00:06:58,639 --> 00:06:59,319
I can't remember.

147
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,279
They were tall,

148
00:07:01,759 --> 00:07:02,360
thin,

149
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:03,839
and pale.

150
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,120
Man or woman?

151
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:05,759
A man.

152
00:07:05,879 --> 00:07:06,959
Any other features?

153
00:07:07,639 --> 00:07:08,600
How did you two get in touch?

154
00:07:09,079 --> 00:07:09,720
It was him.

155
00:07:10,399 --> 00:07:10,800
He was the one

156
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:11,319
who approached me.

157
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:32,680
Calm down.

158
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:35,680
I'm so sorry.

159
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,600
The patient is extremely agitated right now.

160
00:07:37,959 --> 00:07:39,000
That'll have to be all for today.

161
00:07:39,199 --> 00:07:39,759
Please, after you.

162
00:07:46,519 --> 00:07:48,279
I feel like when Zhang Dafeng saw me,

163
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:50,160
he seemed terrified of me.

164
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,720
Even though Zhang Dafeng has a split personality,

165
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:22,519
his emotional responses should still be normal.

166
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,439
He shouldn't be afraid of you.

167
00:08:26,319 --> 00:08:27,560
He should resent you instead,

168
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,279
because you

169
00:08:29,439 --> 00:08:31,199
once took him down outside my door.

170
00:08:31,839 --> 00:08:32,399
I questioned him

171
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,720
about the coin's design

172
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,279
and the person who gave it to him.

173
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:37,879
Just like Li Changyu contacting Cruz,

174
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:39,159
he couldn't reach out on his own.

175
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,279
But Zhang Dafeng met him in person.

176
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:46,000
He was tall, thin, and very pale.

177
00:08:46,879 --> 00:08:47,600
And

178
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:50,440
he terrified him.

179
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:52,039
Shen Yu,

180
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:55,080
I know your background isn't simple.

181
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:56,840
Now that things have come this far,

182
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,240
are you willing to tell me the truth?

183
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,519
I was born into the Shen family of Jiangcheng.

184
00:09:20,679 --> 00:09:21,960
Both my parents were businesspeople.

185
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:25,360
They each had their own businesses to run.

186
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,159
And since it was an arranged marriage,

187
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:31,759
there was no real affection between them.

188
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,240
Though I'm the third child in the family,

189
00:09:38,759 --> 00:09:40,559
I'm their only legitimate heir.

190
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,159
The others...

191
00:09:44,759 --> 00:09:46,240
are all illegitimate siblings.

192
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,799
So there's even less affection to speak of.

193
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,360
When I was 13,

194
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:54,279
my family sent me to Bolton to study.

195
00:09:55,639 --> 00:09:56,559
All this time,

196
00:09:57,799 --> 00:09:58,799
I've always been alone.

197
00:10:00,919 --> 00:10:02,120
So, what was your purpose

198
00:10:02,879 --> 00:10:03,759
in coming to my side?

199
00:10:14,639 --> 00:10:15,399
Shen Xian...

200
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,320
was my brother.

201
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,000
I know.

202
00:10:22,759 --> 00:10:23,519
Shen Xian,

203
00:10:24,799 --> 00:10:25,840
the eldest son of the Shen family,

204
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:28,039
was the serial murder case's

205
00:10:28,039 --> 00:10:29,080
first victim back then.

206
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:35,919
Your mother, Fang Lan, was the second victim.

207
00:10:39,919 --> 00:10:40,720
So...

208
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,240
was it just to solve the case

209
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:44,600
that you became my assistant?

210
00:10:50,759 --> 00:10:51,559
Gu Yan.

211
00:10:53,159 --> 00:10:53,759
All these years,

212
00:10:53,759 --> 00:10:54,919
I've had people look into

213
00:10:54,919 --> 00:10:56,000
this serial murder case,

214
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:57,720
while also receiving

215
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:59,200
all the files from your investigation.

216
00:10:59,919 --> 00:11:02,080
From the moment I met you at 13,

217
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,399
to when I came to your side,

218
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:10,720
it was simply because it was you.
